From ee575601d138a9c90826e2b2cadd507d681fee8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:22:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(esp32c6): correct SLC token fields and read-only status

Use TRM v1.2 chapter 34 and Espressif v5.4.2 slc_reg.h as hardware references. Override only C6 metadata; regenerate its PAC and add host bit-packing regressions. No peripheral or DMA is accessed by the tests.
